---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import Card from '../components/Card.astro';
import CTA from '../components/CTA.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title='Approach | Trouvus' description='The Trouvus Strategy-to-Scale Framework: diagnose, prioritize, design, pilot and scale.'>
<Hero eyebrow="Approach" title="The Trouvus Strategy-to-Scale Framework." lead="A disciplined method for moving from strategic uncertainty to scalable organizational capability." variant="waves" /><section><div class="wrap"><img src="/images/strategy-to-scale.svg" alt="Strategy-to-Scale Framework: Diagnose, Prioritize, Design, Pilot, Scale" width="640" height="300" class="figure-round mb-xs"><div class="steps"><div class="step"><img class="stage-icon" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/stage-diagnose.svg" alt=""><h2>1. Diagnose</h2><p class="small muted">Clarify priorities, readiness, constraints and the current operating system.</p></div><div class="step"><img class="stage-icon" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/stage-prioritize.svg" alt=""><h2>2. Prioritize</h2><p class="small muted">Rank opportunities by value, feasibility, strategic relevance, risk and readiness.</p></div><div class="step"><img class="stage-icon" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/stage-design.svg" alt=""><h2>3. Design</h2><p class="small muted">Redesign decisions, workflows, roles, controls and the human-machine interface.</p></div><div class="step"><img class="stage-icon" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/stage-pilot.svg" alt=""><h2>4. Pilot</h2><p class="small muted">Run bounded experiments with explicit hypotheses, metrics and ownership.</p></div><div class="step"><img class="stage-icon" loading="lazy" decoding="async" src="/images/stage-scale.svg" alt=""><h2>5. Scale</h2><p class="small muted">Institutionalize successful solutions through governance and capability-building.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="rule"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">Diagnostic first</div><h2>Every engagement begins with an honest readiness picture.</h2></div><div><img src="/images/readiness-diagnostic.svg" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="AI Transformation Readiness Diagnostic across five dimensions" width="640" height="300" class="figure-round"><p class="muted">The AI Transformation Readiness Diagnostic assesses strategic alignment, data, technology, governance and workforce capability—identifying the binding constraint before any tool is selected.</p></div></div></section><section class="rule"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow">Engagement principles</div><h2>How we make transformation decisions.</h2></div><div class="grid-2"><Card icon="icon-evidence" title="Evidence before enthusiasm" text="Emerging technology is evaluated against business logic, implementation conditions and verifiable outcomes." /><Card icon="icon-strategy" title="Strategy before technology" text="Technology choices should follow strategic priorities and operating requirements." /><Card icon="icon-workforce" title="Capability before scale" text="Scaling before ownership, competence and governance produces brittle transformation." /><Card icon="icon-bizmodel" title="Human agency alongside automation" text="Efficiency should not be purchased by eroding diagnostic judgment or adaptive capacity." /></div></div></section><CTA flush eyebrow="Executive AI Value Diagnostic" title="Begin with the decision—not the tool." text="A focused 90-minute working session can clarify the opportunity, screen readiness and risk, and define the most credible next step." href="/contact/?interest=diagnostic" label="Request the diagnostic" />
</BaseLayout>
